llet and set aside."},{"n":3,"title":"Cook the vegetables (medium-high, 2 min)","heat":"medium-high","minutes":2,"instructions":"In the same skillet, add red bell pepper and yellow onion. Stir-fry for 2 minutes until the vegetables are tender-crisp."},{"n":4,"title":"Add aromatics and sauce (medium-high, 1.5 min)","heat":"medium-high","minutes":1,"instructions":"Add garlic, ginger root, and crushed red pepper to the skillet. Stir-fry for 30 seconds until fragrant. Return the shrimp to the skillet, then stir in concentrated broth, soy sauce, sugar, and water. Cook for 1 minute until hot."},{"n":5,"title":"Finish and serve (no heat, 2 min)","heat":"no heat","minutes":2,"instructions":"Remove the skillet from heat and stir in sesame oil. Sprinkle with sesame seeds and green onion. Serve the shrimp mixture over jasmine rice."}],"plating":{"serve_style":"stir fry","assembly_instructions":"","optional_toppings":[]},"macros_per_serving":{"calories":201,"protein_g":24,"carbs_g":8,"fat_g":8},"chosen_protein":"seafood","primary_protein_source":"seafood","meal_style":"stir fry","why_it_fits_tonight":"Quick and tasty shrimp stir-fry served over jasmine rice.","cleanup_tip":"Soak pots and pans right after plating while they're still warm. Wipe down prep surfaces and return unused ingredients to storage immediately.","pro_tips":["Scaled from 4 servings to 6 — check single-use items (whole cans, eggs) individually.","Taste and adjust seasoning after scaling — salt doesn't always scale linearly."],"recipe_tags":{"cuisine":"asian","cooking_method":"stir-fry","base_carb":"rice","key_ingredients":["canola oil","shrimp","bell pepper","onion","garlic"],"high_protein":false,"high_fiber":false,"quick_cleanup":false},"template_id":0,"_signature":"stir fry|seafood|asian|rice|stir-fry|flavor concentrated seafood broth,ginger root,jasmine rice,sesame seeds,shrimp,soy sauce,sugar","_id":"05f42fc2-8905-4afe-b5c4-e04814e6d49e"}
